      <h2 data-eh="ks5">2. 排序 Sorting</h2>
      <eh-tabs data-eh="ks6">
        <script type="application/json">{"tabs":[{"title":"思路"},{"title":"代码"},{"title":"复杂度"}]}</script>
        <eh-slot data-eh-slot="0">
          <ol>
            <li data-eh="ks6a">选一个基准 pivot</li>
            <li data-eh="ks6d">分区：小于 pivot 的放左边，其余放右边</li>
            <li data-eh="ks6e">递归处理两侧</li>
          </ol>
        </eh-slot>
        <eh-slot data-eh-slot="1">
          <pre data-eh="ks6b" data-lang="ts"><code>function quickSort(xs: number[]): number[] {
  if (xs.length &lt;= 1) return xs;
  const [p, ...rest] = xs;
  return [...quickSort(rest.filter(x =&gt; x &lt; p)), p, ...quickSort(rest.filter(x =&gt; x &gt;= p))];
}
</code></pre>
        </eh-slot>
        <eh-slot data-eh-slot="2">
          <table data-eh="ks6c">
            <thead><tr><th>情况</th><th>时间</th><th>空间</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>平均</td><td><code>O(n log n)</code></td><td><code>O(log n)</code></td></tr>
              <tr><td>最坏</td><td><code>O(n²)</code></td><td><code>O(n)</code></td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </eh-slot>
      </eh-tabs>
      <eh-chart data-eh="ks7">
        <script type="application/json">{"type":"line","data":{"x":["1k","10k","100k"],"y":[0.2,2.6,31]},"options":{"title":"quickSort 耗时 (ms)"}}</script>
        <!--eh:fallback--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 40" role="img" aria-label="折线图：1k=0.2, 10k=2.6, 100k=31"><polyline fill="none" points="0,40 50,37 100,0" stroke="currentColor"/></svg><!--eh:fallback-->
      </eh-chart>
      <h2 data-eh="ks8">3. 查找 Searching</h2>
      <eh-columns data-eh="ks9">
        <script type="application/json">{"ratio":[1,1]}</script>
        <eh-slot data-eh-slot="0">
          <h3 data-eh="ks9a">二分查找</h3>
          <p data-eh="ks9b">前提：数组<mark>有序</mark>。</p>
          <eh-math data-eh="ks9c">
            <script type="application/json">{"tex":"T(n) = T(n/2) + O(1) \\Rightarrow O(\\log n)"}</script>
            <!--eh:fallback--><pre>T(n) = T(n/2) + O(1) \Rightarrow O(\log n)</pre><!--eh:fallback-->
          </eh-math>
        </eh-slot>
        <eh-slot data-eh-slot="1">
          <h3 data-eh="ks9d">哈希查找</h3>
          <p data-eh="ks9e">平均 O(1)，最坏 O(n)；H<sub>2</sub>O 只是个下标示例，x<sup>2</sup> 是上标示例。</p>
        </eh-slot>
      </eh-columns>
      <eh-mermaid data-eh="ks10">
        <script type="application/json">{"source":"graph LR\n  Q[查询] --> S{有序?}\n  S -->|是| B[二分]\n  S -->|否| H[哈希]"}</script>
        <!--eh:fallback--><pre>graph LR
  Q[查询] --&gt; S{有序?}
  S --&gt;|是| B[二分]
  S --&gt;|否| H[哈希]</pre><!--eh:fallback-->
      </eh-mermaid>
